 ### Custom startup image
 
-On a build with startup image support, open the **Radio** tab in the Codeplug
-Editor, select a PNG, JPEG, or WebP in **Startup image**, and write the codeplug.
+On a build with startup image support, choose **Change Startup Image** in the web installer to open the Codeplug
+Editor at the **Radio** tab. Read from the radio, select a PNG, JPEG, or WebP in **Startup image**, and write the codeplug.
